OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh NHS in strongest pre-winter
OL,4,Aposition ever, says health minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales' health minister has insisted
OL,7,Fthat the Welsh NHS is in its strongest
OL,8,Fposition heading into winter than ever
OL,9,Fbefore.
OL,11,FMabon ap Gwynfor was speaking after the
OL,12,Flatest NHS performance figures showed
OL,13,Fthat more than 11,500 people waited 12
OL,14,Fhours or more in emergency departments
OL,15,Ffrom arrival until admission, transfer
OL,16,For discharge in one month.
OL,18,FIn September, there were 4,900 patient
OL,19,Fpathways waiting more than two years
OL,20,Ffor planned treatment - a fall of 160
OL,21,Fcompared to the previous month.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
