OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh NHS in strongest pre-winter
OL,4,Aposition ever, says health minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the overall number of people
OL,7,Fwaiting for NHS treatment in Wales has
OL,8,Frisen for the sixth month in a row. In
OL,9,FSeptember, there were 721,400 waiting
OL,10,Ffor planned treatment, compared to
OL,11,F714,200 in August.
